WEBVTT

00:31.114 --> 00:33.950
THE TRUNK

00:35.493 --> 00:38.788
2 YEARS AGO

00:56.556 --> 00:57.640
Daddy longlegs.

01:03.271 --> 01:05.607
They live in the basements
of abandoned houses.

01:06.816 --> 01:08.276
You're supposed to kill them.

01:24.709 --> 01:26.669
This isn't an abandoned house.

01:39.015 --> 01:41.643
We just need your signature
right where it says "NM."

01:41.726 --> 01:44.187
We also offer an exclusive
shipping service for this product.

01:44.270 --> 01:45.605
That's okay. I got it.

01:46.397 --> 01:47.565
I'll take a taxi.

02:04.207 --> 02:06.209
The compartments
are sectioned off like this

02:06.292 --> 02:08.044
for convenience and to maximize space.

02:08.128 --> 02:11.005
It'll also help you organize
all your baby items.

02:13.216 --> 02:15.051
That lady left with some

02:16.261 --> 02:17.137
kind of trunk.

02:17.220 --> 02:18.263
Could we see that?

02:18.346 --> 02:19.514
Yes, of course.

02:22.100 --> 02:23.393
Hey, I'm just gonna…

02:24.519 --> 02:25.436
Mm-hmm.

02:52.463 --> 02:53.840
You're getting a divorce, In-ji.

03:01.556 --> 03:02.891
Your father's dead.

03:04.434 --> 03:06.227
I think your punishment is over.

03:08.897 --> 03:11.274
Don't worry.
You'll receive generous alimony.

03:12.233 --> 03:14.319
It's our fault the contract failed,
isn't it?

03:16.404 --> 03:17.238
Oh.

03:18.364 --> 03:19.866
I went through NM to find Ji-o.

03:23.995 --> 03:25.747
I'm sure that's no surprise.

04:53.876 --> 04:55.295
Why are you awake?

04:57.463 --> 05:00.383
Are you thinking about what Seo-yeon said?
That why you can't sleep?

05:09.017 --> 05:12.145
You kick at the comforter
in your sleep over and over again.

05:13.396 --> 05:15.773
You're staying up
so you can keep fixing it?

05:16.441 --> 05:18.651
One of us should get to be comfortable.

05:43.760 --> 05:46.220
So what can we do
to make you feel comfortable?

05:48.681 --> 05:51.225
I want both of us
to be able to rest together.

05:53.728 --> 05:55.605
We wake up tomorrow and

05:56.898 --> 05:59.275
realize we're both 20 years older now.

06:05.406 --> 06:07.950
And we're both so tired of each other.

06:08.701 --> 06:10.995
Obviously, I know everybody you know,

06:11.829 --> 06:14.082
and you know everybody I know too.

06:16.667 --> 06:19.796
Taking turns gossiping about them
is our one joy in life.

06:20.713 --> 06:23.633
We have breakfast,
and we don't even clean our eye boogers.

06:25.635 --> 06:28.846
We've been fused at the hip so long,
I'm sick of looking at you.

06:32.683 --> 06:34.143
We argue over nothing,

06:34.894 --> 06:36.687
then we grill some fish for supper,

06:37.855 --> 06:39.482
and we fall asleep together.

06:41.651 --> 06:44.487
Then we just get up the next morning
and do it again.

06:45.113 --> 06:47.115
That sounds so tedious.

06:49.575 --> 06:50.451
True.

06:51.911 --> 06:54.205
I could do it though. Be tedious.

08:04.650 --> 08:07.153
I track him through brokers,
so my hands are tied.

08:07.236 --> 08:09.280
He just disappeared all of a sudden.

08:11.949 --> 08:13.993
You can tell me to stop looking, you know.

08:15.286 --> 08:16.370
Uh, no.

08:17.622 --> 08:18.831
I want you to keep looking.

08:24.962 --> 08:26.172
Five months?

08:27.381 --> 08:28.508
Twenty-four weeks.

08:29.842 --> 08:31.677
Your husband still have his mind made up?

08:32.345 --> 08:34.514
I couldn't get an abortion anyway,
so who cares?

08:47.151 --> 08:49.654
SENDER NOH IN-JI
DEPOSIT 20,000,000 WON

08:51.948 --> 08:52.949
That's a lot.

08:53.032 --> 08:55.868
Well, once the baby's here,
it'll be tough without it.

08:55.952 --> 08:58.287
Make sure you get a decent place
just for you.

08:59.372 --> 09:01.290
Somewhere your husband won't find you.

09:08.047 --> 09:11.259
I can't believe I'm actually…
about to thank

09:12.343 --> 09:13.803
a rude-ass South Korean.

09:15.638 --> 09:19.141
It would break you
if you were to lose your child.

09:19.809 --> 09:21.227
Maybe don't thank me yet.

09:23.062 --> 09:25.398
Don't let marriage get
too limiting either.

09:26.232 --> 09:27.400
Divorce isn't a…

09:34.657 --> 09:36.075
big deal, after all.

09:47.753 --> 09:49.422
There's something
you should see.

10:26.208 --> 10:27.960
HAN JEONG-WON

10:31.297 --> 10:32.882
When did you leave the house?

10:33.549 --> 10:34.634
Early morning.

10:36.052 --> 10:37.428
Well, is something wrong?

10:38.054 --> 10:40.139
Oh, no. I'm just making sure you're okay.

10:42.224 --> 10:43.476
I'm glad you're safe.

10:44.143 --> 10:45.102
Thanks for calling.

10:45.186 --> 10:47.772
I can't do breakfast today.

11:26.769 --> 11:28.896
You know how
Ms. Do-dam keeps saying

11:28.979 --> 11:31.482
someone's sneaking in
to kill off the goldfish every night?

11:31.565 --> 11:34.527
I brushed it off as bullshit at first,
but then she got me worrying,

11:34.610 --> 11:37.029
so I recorded some footage just in case.

11:37.113 --> 11:38.864
Can't believe I caught this, you know?

11:41.283 --> 11:43.828
That's your guy, right?
The attempted marrier.

11:45.287 --> 11:48.416
W… w… what should I call him? Um, Aquaman?

11:50.918 --> 11:52.294
No, it wasn't him.

11:53.170 --> 11:55.423
If he was anywhere near here, I'd know.

11:55.506 --> 11:58.718
Yeah? Then who else would come through
the front door in the middle of the night

11:58.801 --> 12:02.263
just so… so they could peep
into the goddamn fish tank like a nutjob?

13:00.488 --> 13:01.697
Buy me some food.

13:02.406 --> 13:03.324
We should talk.

13:26.180 --> 13:27.139
Mmm.

13:27.973 --> 13:29.975
I always feel weird when I'm eating these.

13:31.018 --> 13:32.102
Ah! It kinda makes me go,

13:32.186 --> 13:35.606
"Right, I forgot that pretty much
everything I eat used to be alive."

13:36.524 --> 13:39.652
But it's normal to feel discomfort
when biting into a creature's flesh, huh?

13:46.367 --> 13:47.535
It's amazing though.

13:50.037 --> 13:52.206
- If you're just gonna waste my time--
- Oh, that's right.

13:52.289 --> 13:54.041
We're here to talk about Noh In-ji.

14:04.051 --> 14:06.971
You know about
that pervert she was engaged to.

14:10.099 --> 14:11.809
Ooh, you know.

14:13.269 --> 14:14.812
He owns In-ji's place too.

14:14.895 --> 14:18.440
My point is, it's been five years
since that fucker ran away like a coward,

14:18.524 --> 14:20.651
and she's still hanging around that place.

14:22.152 --> 14:24.864
I still don't get why
she's so hung up on that deviant.

14:26.115 --> 14:26.949
You know?

14:29.118 --> 14:32.288
Just call the cops. You've got a problem
whether it was him or not.

14:32.788 --> 14:35.457
Call them for what?
This isn't my house.

14:35.541 --> 14:38.377
I should report a break-in
at a place my ex left five years ago

14:38.460 --> 14:40.754
when all the accused did
was clean the fish tank?

14:41.338 --> 14:44.383
I'd also have to tell them
I've been living here for several years.

14:44.884 --> 14:46.552
All that just to stand my ground.

14:46.635 --> 14:48.053
Ugh, shit.

14:49.096 --> 14:52.182
Maybe I can, uh…
Maybe I'll switch the door code.

14:53.893 --> 14:56.228
By the way,
don't tell Ms. Do-dam about the new code.

14:56.312 --> 14:58.188
She's such a blabbermouth. Jesus.

14:59.815 --> 15:00.941
Hey, In-ji.

15:01.901 --> 15:03.903
You know you're acting
kinda strange, right?

15:08.073 --> 15:09.325
Where are you going?

15:09.408 --> 15:11.076
I need to check something.

15:15.331 --> 15:19.126
She attended the workshop I ran
for about three months.

15:19.209 --> 15:20.169
When she did good work,

15:20.252 --> 15:23.380
her company would pay for training
in different areas, like cooking classes.

15:24.381 --> 15:27.301
The two of them looked great together
until I found out about him.

15:27.384 --> 15:30.471
They were the kinda couple that'd
make you do a double take on the street.

15:31.305 --> 15:32.222
In the end,

15:32.306 --> 15:36.560
all I got to see was In-ji's entire life
fall apart in front of me.

15:38.479 --> 15:39.396
You saw it?

15:39.897 --> 15:41.273
A week or so before the wedding,

15:41.357 --> 15:44.151
a few photos
started circulating on the Internet.

15:44.818 --> 15:47.321
A bunch of guys all on top of each other.

15:50.032 --> 15:51.200
All their mouths going.

15:53.786 --> 15:57.164
How would you feel if hundreds
of thousands of people saw all that?

16:05.339 --> 16:07.257
He dropped off the face of the earth,

16:08.425 --> 16:10.302
and In-ji had to take the fallout.

16:10.970 --> 16:13.472
Don't get me started
on those megacorp fuckers.

16:13.555 --> 16:16.183
They sent their legal team after her.
Told her to sign an agreement

16:16.266 --> 16:18.852
that she wouldn't raise any issues
over the incident,

16:18.936 --> 16:21.814
all 'cause they didn't wanna
look like homo-bashers.

16:25.859 --> 16:28.445
I bet you don't know
what hate means, do you?

16:30.280 --> 16:32.032
You have no idea…

16:34.076 --> 16:38.122
how worthless it can make you feel,
how bad it can get.

16:46.672 --> 16:49.133
In-ji is basically an orphan.

16:49.758 --> 16:53.012
She cut ties with her family,
and she made herself numb.

16:55.514 --> 16:58.726
Fucking A. She's so goddamn tenacious.

17:01.186 --> 17:03.731
And that's why I think
Noh In-ji is a goddess.

17:15.034 --> 17:18.037
Just call me a bitch and get it over with.
You'll sleep a lot better at night

17:18.120 --> 17:19.288
once it's out of your system.

17:19.371 --> 17:21.206
So why won't you just say it?

17:22.124 --> 17:23.083
I can't.

17:25.544 --> 17:27.421
So, come on, you're divorcing me?

17:29.465 --> 17:30.716
Mm-hmm.

17:30.799 --> 17:33.552
It'll ruin your life
if you get back with Jeong-won.

17:34.803 --> 17:36.472
You and I are so happy together.

17:38.599 --> 17:41.643
You sound deranged.
Or you're working extra hard.

17:47.691 --> 17:49.318
You never know.
Double-check it.

17:49.401 --> 17:52.321
Got it. And we've got
a great crew on this project,

17:52.404 --> 17:54.156
so I'm sure we'll make the deadline.

18:13.092 --> 18:14.593
This room's last on the list.

18:15.219 --> 18:17.596
Tell me what you want,
and I'll take care of it.

18:18.931 --> 18:20.516
What the hell are you thinking?

18:21.058 --> 18:22.184
What? With the divorce?

18:23.894 --> 18:27.356
You're the one
who arranged this whole thing.

18:27.856 --> 18:29.775
You know it's not just between us anymore.

18:29.858 --> 18:31.777
It's between the four of us?

18:33.570 --> 18:35.781
When you break a contract,
you just need to pay the fine.

18:35.864 --> 18:37.741
That's all there is to it. Voilà.

18:44.915 --> 18:47.584
Stop fighting it, and take the meds.
You have the ones I gave you?

18:47.668 --> 18:50.337
So… that's your solution? Drugs?

18:50.838 --> 18:53.215
Why did you change your damn mind, huh?!

18:55.259 --> 18:57.136
Well, I'm convinced
I've seen all I need to.

18:57.970 --> 18:59.513
Do I really need to go on?

19:00.597 --> 19:02.266
Hurry up and end things.

19:03.433 --> 19:05.144
Then we can go back to
the way things were.

19:24.121 --> 19:26.039
OPEN DOOR

19:27.666 --> 19:30.252
So… that's your solution?
Drugs?

19:31.253 --> 19:33.338
Why did you change your damn mind, huh?!

19:40.053 --> 19:43.056
Hey, come get me.
I'm not feeling well. I need to come home.

19:44.099 --> 19:45.767
I'm sorry. I don't think I can.

19:46.560 --> 19:47.853
A guest dropped in.

19:48.562 --> 19:50.022
Oh yeah? Who is it?

19:50.105 --> 19:52.316
She just showed up. It's In-ji.

20:14.671 --> 20:16.840
Tea is kinda boring,
so I brought you this.

20:16.924 --> 20:18.800
It's non-alcoholic, but it's not bad.

20:22.763 --> 20:24.264
I didn't think you'd come over here.

20:27.684 --> 20:29.269
I had to look into an issue.

20:30.562 --> 20:32.272
And what do you plan to do after that?

20:34.316 --> 20:38.153
You know the Judgment of Solomon?
With the real mother and the imposter.

20:40.072 --> 20:41.073
SEO-YEON

20:43.200 --> 20:45.202
Hey, driver!

20:46.119 --> 20:48.247
Just please step on it!

20:49.665 --> 20:51.917
The judgment
always struck me as odd.

20:52.584 --> 20:53.627
If one of them was a phony,

20:53.710 --> 20:56.672
it's still hard to believe
anyone would cut an infant in half.

20:56.755 --> 20:59.007
Her disregard for the child's life
implies she

21:00.133 --> 21:01.843
was in a very dark place to begin with.

21:01.927 --> 21:04.471
She was just a shell.
Her life was destroyed.

21:06.306 --> 21:07.349
I can relate to her.

21:08.600 --> 21:11.478
Or she's another evil bitch
that's just really cruel.

21:12.062 --> 21:14.147
Only this one lived 3,000 years ago.

21:19.528 --> 21:21.196
She's gonna be here soon.

21:28.161 --> 21:29.371
Ah!

21:30.080 --> 21:32.249
Wine you might wanna scrub right away.

21:32.833 --> 21:34.376
Use the second-floor bathroom.

21:35.627 --> 21:37.629
Go to the left of Seo-yeon's study.

21:39.589 --> 21:40.716
You'll find it there.

23:30.992 --> 23:33.620
Oh, no.
I'm just making sure you're okay.

23:34.162 --> 23:35.330
I'm glad you're safe.

23:36.289 --> 23:37.416
Thanks for calling.

23:38.125 --> 23:40.377
I can't do breakfast today.

24:04.401 --> 24:05.569
Coming home soon?

24:36.558 --> 24:37.767
Why didn't you answer?

24:38.393 --> 24:40.854
Oh. Forgot my phone, I guess.

24:41.646 --> 24:42.814
I was just rinsing off.

24:44.733 --> 24:45.901
Where's In-ji?

24:46.943 --> 24:47.986
She's already gone.

24:48.904 --> 24:50.363
Guess I should've told you.

24:57.871 --> 24:59.206
Did you guys talk, hmm?

24:59.706 --> 25:03.251
Strategy meeting between coworkers
about the contract termination.

25:05.295 --> 25:08.798
Is that acceptable?
Does that put your mind at ease, Seo-yeon?

26:01.101 --> 26:02.477
What did you do today?

26:03.895 --> 26:06.773
I took care of something with a friend.
At my old place, you know.

26:09.150 --> 26:10.277
Your old place?

26:14.406 --> 26:15.991
Today, I ran into someone I know.

26:16.866 --> 26:19.035
We're not even that close,
but we got soju.

26:21.204 --> 26:22.664
Was it decent soju?

26:25.542 --> 26:26.751
I can't recall.

26:45.770 --> 26:48.148
Do you wanna head upstairs
with a few cold ones?

26:49.733 --> 26:50.650
Sure.

27:39.699 --> 27:42.118
The Brazilian winger's
got it down there.

27:42.202 --> 27:44.537
He's done a little Cruyff turn
into the box.

27:44.621 --> 27:46.539
Ah, he's been blocked by the defender.

27:48.291 --> 27:53.088
Fantastic strike on goal,
just over the bar by the Welsh wizard.

27:53.171 --> 27:57.467
I found the supplier. Mr. Yoon.
He's got a reputation in this business.

27:58.885 --> 28:00.679
All right, where can I meet him?

28:11.856 --> 28:13.274
Got more of that stuff?

28:15.819 --> 28:17.529
We should talk in person.

28:21.950 --> 28:23.743
I'll visit you
at work tomorrow.

29:10.874 --> 29:13.168
Did you text me
using Jeong-won's cell phone?

29:14.461 --> 29:17.589
I just wanted to make sense of it,
why you're doing this.

29:18.673 --> 29:20.341
Think you know Jeong-won?

29:20.425 --> 29:22.594
Well, sounds like you think you know him.

29:23.261 --> 29:24.637
Is that why you're lying?

29:25.764 --> 29:27.098
You should be careful.

29:28.308 --> 29:30.185
You'll be divorced soon, after all.

29:31.269 --> 29:32.312
Oh, no.

29:32.854 --> 29:34.355
He and I aren't divorcing.

29:35.023 --> 29:36.316
I won't cooperate.

29:38.109 --> 29:41.446
The manual says, "Only the married couple
can decide on a divorce."

29:42.238 --> 29:44.157
That's how it works in the real world.

29:47.410 --> 29:48.745
Don't come near that man.

29:50.038 --> 29:51.456
Consider this a warning.

29:55.043 --> 29:57.962
You know, I think you should've said that
a lot sooner to your mother.

29:59.297 --> 30:01.508
Should've told her
not to mess with your man.

30:03.051 --> 30:06.095
Although, for a low-rent whore,
you really have an amazing ability

30:06.179 --> 30:08.264
to bring bad luck to everyone around.

30:09.432 --> 30:10.475
You're poisonous.

30:12.811 --> 30:14.395
I'm glad I see that

30:15.355 --> 30:17.607
scheming skanks like you basically

30:18.441 --> 30:20.443
haven't changed in 3,000 years.

30:54.227 --> 30:56.729
Why are you pushing these drugs
to my husband? What do you gain?

30:56.813 --> 30:57.981
It's basically meth.

31:01.025 --> 31:03.444
You think I'm giving him those
so he gets hooked?

31:04.195 --> 31:05.238
Tell me why, then.

31:06.698 --> 31:09.868
You don't think I actually
owe you an explanation, do you?

31:15.123 --> 31:16.541
Does your client know?

31:17.584 --> 31:20.962
You hired a junkie
so you have a steady flow of drugs?

31:23.006 --> 31:24.757
You know, I can't help but wonder

31:24.841 --> 31:27.260
if you might be losing sleep
over that tonight.

31:28.511 --> 31:30.263
I can make your life worse if you want.

31:43.276 --> 31:44.944
You threatening me?

31:46.654 --> 31:48.489
It's a lot more than a threat.

31:49.073 --> 31:51.993
His father monitored his mom
the way you've been doing it.

31:52.076 --> 31:53.953
He put cameras in the lights.

31:54.037 --> 31:56.122
What kind of monster would do that, huh?

32:04.631 --> 32:07.175
And I know you wanted him
to take all of these!

32:08.134 --> 32:10.887
You had to break Jeong-won
so he would go back to you!

32:12.096 --> 32:15.058
What was it like to watch him on camera?
Did you enjoy it?

32:15.141 --> 32:17.268
Did it feel like you had him
in the palm of your hand?

32:17.352 --> 32:19.187
Did you feel like some kind of god?

32:20.355 --> 32:21.648
How could you do that?

32:22.732 --> 32:24.901
You're an animal! This is unforgivable!

32:35.536 --> 32:37.288
Why are you doing all this?

32:37.372 --> 32:39.165
Why would you go this far
for a man like that?

33:09.320 --> 33:10.947
You don't get it!

33:11.030 --> 33:12.532
Jeong-won and I are together!

33:13.032 --> 33:14.617
It's our life, not yours!

33:14.701 --> 33:16.327
And who gets to live it?!

34:03.082 --> 34:04.751
We're getting a divorce?

34:04.834 --> 34:07.003
How am I supposed
to get over you, Seo-yeon?

34:09.672 --> 34:13.843
I just have to obey all your decisions,
and there's nothing I can do to stop you?

34:14.719 --> 34:16.095
You know, I'm human too.

34:35.948 --> 34:37.742
The director
said they liked it.

34:37.825 --> 34:40.203
Sure, he had some tiny notes
here and there,

34:41.746 --> 34:43.456
but to think
there's another being on Earth

34:43.539 --> 34:44.832
who shares your eccentric tastes.

34:46.334 --> 34:49.128
You decided how you're gonna
end things with In-ji yet?

34:50.088 --> 34:50.922
Oh.

34:53.257 --> 34:55.468
Don't rekindle things with Seo-yeon.

34:56.469 --> 34:59.722
I don't know what she's thinking,
but for you, this is a huge opportunity.

34:59.806 --> 35:01.599
Break it off for good. Got it?

35:02.600 --> 35:04.644
Seo-yeon told us to divorce.

35:04.727 --> 35:06.229
God, she's nuts.

35:08.856 --> 35:10.691
The truth is, I adore In-ji.

35:14.737 --> 35:15.863
How'd that happen?

35:16.906 --> 35:18.407
Man, long story.

35:20.701 --> 35:25.540
You do know that you can't have
a serious relationship with her, right?

35:28.626 --> 35:29.710
Why?

35:30.294 --> 35:31.754
Man, it's the protocol.

35:32.713 --> 35:35.049
You literally can't do anything
with Noh In-ji.

35:35.133 --> 35:37.677
"Any couple matched through NM
must get married through NM too."

35:37.760 --> 35:40.221
It's in the manual, dude.
You can't blow off the manual.

35:50.231 --> 35:52.692
Ah shit. How the hell does this work?

35:52.775 --> 35:53.776
Is this it?

35:55.236 --> 35:56.654
Oh.

36:04.328 --> 36:05.788
What the hell are you doing?

36:07.039 --> 36:08.875
Ah, damn it.

36:12.420 --> 36:13.629
8828.

36:21.012 --> 36:22.388
I guess it wasn't this guy.

36:23.806 --> 36:25.641
You… you think it's not him?
Think she's right?

36:26.350 --> 36:27.768
My vision is blurry.

36:27.852 --> 36:29.270
I need glasses.

36:30.062 --> 36:31.397
Who knows if she's right.

36:32.064 --> 36:35.443
You've been far-sighted
for a while now. Come on.

36:35.526 --> 36:37.570
Just… just look at the picture. Here.

36:39.572 --> 36:42.200
- Five years is a long time.
- It really is.

36:42.867 --> 36:46.162
If he said anything at all before he left,
In-ji wouldn't have hung around.

36:46.662 --> 36:49.540
I don't think she would've felt obligated
to take care of the house.

36:50.082 --> 36:51.542
I don't think she'd care.

36:51.626 --> 36:54.545
I think In-ji's been watching his place
'cause he never said it was over.

38:22.216 --> 38:23.884
Do you wanna go eat?

38:26.220 --> 38:27.305
Definitely.

38:29.056 --> 38:30.349
I'm starving.

38:38.316 --> 38:40.985
Hey, can I get, uh,
two cheeseburger combos?

38:41.068 --> 38:42.069
No tomatoes, please.

38:42.153 --> 38:45.698
Sure, no problem, sir.
It'll be ready in a few minutes.

38:55.791 --> 38:59.211
Two cheeseburger combos. Thank you, enjoy.

38:59.295 --> 39:00.421
Thank you.

39:18.522 --> 39:20.649
I asked them to hold the tomatoes on both.

39:21.442 --> 39:22.818
Since we're vegetarians.

39:26.197 --> 39:27.073
You're sweet.

39:33.371 --> 39:34.914
I missed you all day today.

39:39.502 --> 39:42.004
So much, it was tough
to get through the afternoon.

39:54.433 --> 39:56.394
I didn't think it was that difficult.

40:16.455 --> 40:17.873
You know I'm kidding, right?

42:12.738 --> 42:14.698
Back up.

42:14.782 --> 42:18.327
Wrong way.
You don't know how to back up?

42:18.410 --> 42:19.787
I'm killing it.

42:20.287 --> 42:21.539
Oh. Ooh!

42:21.622 --> 42:22.706
Whoa!

42:24.625 --> 42:27.586
- Why'd you take up kayaking?
- Because I can't swim.

42:28.587 --> 42:29.547
Really?

42:30.673 --> 42:33.551
Yeah, I almost drowned once
in a lake when I was little.

42:35.678 --> 42:38.138
After that,
I just couldn't bring myself to learn.

42:40.182 --> 42:42.393
Eventually,
I learned how to swim in college…

42:44.395 --> 42:45.396
and then

42:47.147 --> 42:48.816
a close friend of mine wound up drowning.

42:48.899 --> 42:49.942
It was

42:50.442 --> 42:51.527
suicide.

42:55.614 --> 42:57.366
Never swam again after that.

43:01.453 --> 43:04.957
Wow. I just wanted to know
why you learned to kayak.

43:05.958 --> 43:07.918
But now I'm too scared to keep listening.

43:12.464 --> 43:14.049
Can I ask why you enjoy it?

43:19.096 --> 43:21.307
Well, it makes me feel
like a little island.

43:23.058 --> 43:25.269
I float around, and I'm completely free.

43:25.769 --> 43:27.062
Nothing can harm me.

43:57.551 --> 43:59.386
HUSBAND

44:02.640 --> 44:03.515
Uh-huh.

44:05.601 --> 44:07.019
Yeah, I'm on my way.

44:23.577 --> 44:24.787
I gave you a job.

44:24.870 --> 44:28.165
Things should be accelerating on your end,
so why haven't I heard from you?

44:30.042 --> 44:33.504
You've kept me in the dark for so long,
I thought I'd pay you a visit.

44:35.214 --> 44:36.256
Who's…

44:50.229 --> 44:51.188
This tea,

44:52.064 --> 44:53.399
it's really good.

44:56.485 --> 44:59.196
Mmm. I'd love if you could
pack me a little for the road.

45:03.575 --> 45:04.743
So why'd you come here?

45:07.538 --> 45:12.334
It's amazing just how damn small
the world can… can be, right?

45:14.712 --> 45:17.423
You know,
I met up with an old friend a while back.

45:17.506 --> 45:19.967
He said he got sent
an unusual job at his company.

45:20.467 --> 45:23.470
He had to hide a camera in a chandelier.

45:24.680 --> 45:27.182
I think it could've been from France,
around there.

45:28.350 --> 45:30.144
He also told me it's a priceless fixture.

45:30.227 --> 45:32.271
There's only a few
in the whole country, apparently.

45:32.896 --> 45:34.773
Special order. Uh-huh.

45:34.857 --> 45:37.317
I heard the owner jumped through
a lot of hoops to get it.

45:39.611 --> 45:40.571
Although…

45:43.574 --> 45:45.743
why would anyone want a camera up there?

45:54.418 --> 45:56.670
I'd love to find out why, you know?

46:24.865 --> 46:27.409
The last time, I didn't really…

46:28.118 --> 46:30.579
Well, to be totally honest,
I didn't want to… to, you know,

46:30.662 --> 46:32.790
speak ill of the dead in any way, so…

46:33.332 --> 46:35.334
so basically,
I couldn't tell you everything.

46:36.502 --> 46:37.795
But the guy didn't seem…

46:38.462 --> 46:40.214
Look, he definitely was not normal.

46:41.924 --> 46:43.008
How so?

46:44.092 --> 46:45.469
Well, he must've

46:46.553 --> 46:48.889
had a lot of enemies.
He was hard to be around.

46:50.307 --> 46:52.017
He was erratic, I guess?

46:52.643 --> 46:54.102
Eom Tae-seong wasn't well-liked.

46:54.186 --> 46:56.522
Do you know anyone
who might've wanted to hurt the guy?

46:57.022 --> 46:59.983
Well, I don't really have any way
of knowing who specifically.

47:00.067 --> 47:02.110
Most people that meet him
are put off right away.

47:02.194 --> 47:04.530
Seo-yeon didn't like him, that's for sure.

47:04.613 --> 47:06.573
She said this in passing,
so I could be wrong,

47:06.657 --> 47:07.908
but she said he tried

47:09.117 --> 47:10.077
to blackmail her.

47:10.160 --> 47:11.537
He even went to her office.

47:14.873 --> 47:17.668
Although I don't know the whole story.

47:21.505 --> 47:22.631
Blackmail?

47:35.561 --> 47:38.772
- I just wanna hear the FX real quick.
- Just the FX, you got it.

47:45.988 --> 47:49.658
I know this killer beef tripe
hotpot place. Wanna grab lunch?

47:59.293 --> 48:00.961
Otherwise, I'll just go with In-ji.

48:17.185 --> 48:19.313
He got that stab wound
long before he died.

48:19.396 --> 48:22.024
Maybe a paring knife,
what you use to cut fruit.

48:22.107 --> 48:23.650
It's quite a deep wound, actually.

48:25.193 --> 48:27.362
He wouldn't have gone down easy
with wounds this bad.

48:27.446 --> 48:29.156
He probably killed whoever stabbed him.

48:29.239 --> 48:31.074
Exactly. We're mostly guessing though.

48:31.158 --> 48:33.160
No clear signs of a struggle
or anything like that.

48:34.745 --> 48:36.997
- Self-inflicted, then?
- Come on. This guy?

48:37.706 --> 48:39.917
Usually, those people
don't stop after the first one.

48:40.000 --> 48:41.793
Cutting like that is a compulsion.

48:52.095 --> 48:54.097
I was hoping you'd buy lunch.

48:55.182 --> 48:56.308
What is this about?

48:58.602 --> 48:59.811
That man's house,

49:00.312 --> 49:04.024
it's been vacant for about five years now,
and In-ji's still taking care of it.

49:04.608 --> 49:05.984
She hasn't changed a thing.

49:06.902 --> 49:08.445
That's crazy, bro.

49:10.781 --> 49:12.032
How do you know that?

49:16.286 --> 49:18.038
Most deadbolts aren't an issue.

49:20.582 --> 49:21.583
Do you know…

49:23.919 --> 49:25.379
why In-ji chose you?

49:27.005 --> 49:29.049
The first man she married
and her fourth husband,

49:29.132 --> 49:30.425
both of them were really sick.

49:30.509 --> 49:32.928
As in terminally ill.

49:33.011 --> 49:34.304
One of them was gay

49:34.388 --> 49:37.307
who only got married
because his family wanted him to.

49:37.391 --> 49:38.433
And the other one…

49:40.644 --> 49:42.854
had no sex drive, no libido at all.

49:44.439 --> 49:46.650
I'm not sure if he didn't want to
or he had issues.

49:47.317 --> 49:49.736
So why you, then, Jeong-won?

49:54.449 --> 49:57.285
Your wife divorced you
'cause your dick didn't work?

49:59.955 --> 50:01.164
Dude.

50:02.290 --> 50:04.418
Bad joke. Kidding, hmm?

50:10.048 --> 50:12.551
Anyway, what I'm trying to say is…

50:18.181 --> 50:20.892
…I think In-ji and I are destined
to perish side by side.

50:22.853 --> 50:24.271
If I can't have her…

50:27.691 --> 50:29.401
…that's a pretty good alternative.

50:30.235 --> 50:31.361
Ya know?

50:35.282 --> 50:37.784
So how long
have you known Han Jeong-won?

50:38.368 --> 50:40.996
Since he was about 17 or so.

50:41.079 --> 50:42.330
He got on the drugs

50:42.998 --> 50:44.624
after his mom committed suicide.

50:44.708 --> 50:45.667
Mm.

50:46.501 --> 50:49.629
There was a blurb… about it
on the news back then.

50:49.713 --> 50:53.467
"Underage corporate heir
taken into custody for drug abuse."

50:53.550 --> 50:55.260
The thing he got busted with

50:56.344 --> 50:58.930
was some kind of
manufactured cannabinoid pill.

50:59.431 --> 51:03.310
You don't… see too many of those even now.
They're so tough to produce.

51:06.104 --> 51:07.397
Even the name was weird.

51:07.481 --> 51:10.317
So we decided
we'd just call it the blue pill.

51:13.153 --> 51:14.780
Do you… do you know if he ever relapsed?

51:16.031 --> 51:19.951
Well, I do have my hunches, yeah.
Just never been able to get evidence.

51:21.995 --> 51:25.457
So did, uh, did Jeong-won kill anyone?

51:26.458 --> 51:28.502
Not yet, he hasn't. Go ahead.

53:19.613 --> 53:21.740
The number you have dialed is…

53:21.823 --> 53:23.783
NOH IN-JI

53:28.580 --> 53:30.248
Hello?

53:31.666 --> 53:34.002
What's up? Where are you?

53:34.085 --> 53:35.003
At home?

53:35.503 --> 53:37.547
I left.
I needed to take care of something.

53:38.048 --> 53:38.965
Where are you?

53:39.591 --> 53:40.759
At my old house.

53:41.718 --> 53:43.720
Any chance you could come back here?

53:45.096 --> 53:46.264
Is something wrong?

53:48.475 --> 53:50.769
Just… come back home for a while.

53:51.561 --> 53:53.980
Uh, actually, I'll go over there.

53:54.064 --> 53:54.940
Where is it?

53:55.023 --> 53:56.441
This won't take long at all.

53:57.234 --> 53:58.318
I'll be back soon.

54:35.522 --> 54:36.439
Hmm?

54:42.904 --> 54:43.780
What the…

54:47.492 --> 54:48.827
Well, this is it.

54:54.374 --> 54:55.375
What the fuck?

54:59.212 --> 55:00.213
God damn it!

55:11.766 --> 55:12.767
In-ji?
